    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "Layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ECommunity facilities and areas of open space \u003Cstrong\u003Eshould \u003C/strong\u003Ebe integrated with the footpath and cycle network. Open spaces \u003Cstrong\u003Eshould \u003C/strong\u003Ebe in open view from main pedestrian and cycle routes within the development to enable informal supervision from passers-by. Routes to and through these spaces \u003Cstrong\u003Eshould \u003C/strong\u003Ebe well-lit, overlooked, and feel safe and accessible for all users. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOn larger sites open spaces \u003Cstrong\u003Eshould \u003C/strong\u003Ebe located alongside other community facilities to create a clear focal point for the community, which \u003Cstrong\u003Eshould \u003C/strong\u003Ebe agreed with the council as required.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </description>
    <developmentScales>
      <Value><![CDATA[[
  "Other Major Applications",
  "Major Residential Applications (10\u002B homes)"
]]]></Value>
